What is the output of the following basic copy constructor program?
```java
class StudentRecord {
    int studentId;
    StudentRecord(int id) {
        this.studentId = id;
    }
    StudentRecord(StudentRecord other) {
        this.studentId = other.studentId;
    }
}
public class CopyDemoApp {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        StudentRecord s1 = new StudentRecord(101);
        StudentRecord s2 = new StudentRecord(s1);
        s2.studentId = 202;
        System.out.println(s1.studentId + " " + s2.studentId);
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following shallow copy trap program?
```java
class EngineBlock {
    int horsepower;
    EngineBlock(int hp) { this.horsepower = hp; }
}
class VehicleUnit {
    EngineBlock engine;
    VehicleUnit(EngineBlock e) { this.engine = e; }
    VehicleUnit(VehicleUnit other) {
        this.engine = other.engine; // shallow copy
    }
}
public class ShallowTrapMain {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        VehicleUnit v1 = new VehicleUnit(new EngineBlock(300));
        VehicleUnit v2 = new VehicleUnit(v1);
        v2.engine.horsepower = 450;
        System.out.println(v1.engine.horsepower);
    }
}
```

