What is the output of the following deep copy constructor program?
```java
class AddressTag {
    String city;
    AddressTag(String city) { this.city = city; }
}
class CompanyProfile {
    AddressTag address;
    CompanyProfile(AddressTag a) { this.address = a; }
    CompanyProfile(CompanyProfile other) {
        this.address = new AddressTag(other.address.city); // deep copy
    }
}
public class DeepCopyMain {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        CompanyProfile cp1 = new CompanyProfile(new AddressTag("Boston"));
        CompanyProfile cp2 = new CompanyProfile(cp1);
        cp2.address.city = "Seattle";
        System.out.println(cp1.address.city + ":" + cp2.address.city);
    }
}
```

