What is the output of the following immutable field copy constructor program?
```java
class ImmutableRecord {
    final String label;
    final int value;
    ImmutableRecord(String l, int v) {
        this.label = l;
        this.value = v;
    }
    ImmutableRecord(ImmutableRecord other) {
        this.label = other.label;
        this.value = other.value;
    }
}
public class ImmutableCopyMain {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        ImmutableRecord rec1 = new ImmutableRecord("A", 10);
        ImmutableRecord rec2 = new ImmutableRecord(rec1);
        System.out.println((rec1 == rec2) + " " + (rec1.label == rec2.label));
    }
}
```
